# moodcafe
Amood-based wellness website that serves you a menu to college group project bt anshal ,swapna and sirat .
## about
A visitor shares their mood, answers five gental questions , and gets a personal 
report with ideas for meditation, exercise, music,food. if stress is high.
## features
-Mood check-in form(6 moods +5 questions) with vaalidation
-stress score: low(1-9),medium(10-14),hight(+15)
-personal relex menu that changes by stress level 
-1-minute animated breathing exercise
"thought for today" quote button 
